<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed men seized a supermarket in Cartagena, taking at least 25 hostages and prompting armed police to surround the site. Simultaneously, a car bomb exploded in a central Colombian city, destroying buildings and injuring more than 20 people, while another car bomb hit the governor's office in Meta. The ELN carried out a drone strike on a police base, injuring three people including an infant, and a separate drone strike hit a Colombian city. The Colombian president blamed ex-FARC rebels for the car bomb blast. Violence remains high, with 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/car-bomb-destroys-buildings-in-central-colombian-city&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/americas/colombia-farc-peace-deal.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPUXk2MmFURDEwYmxvTFItajUwUC1YQWVXMDNYSXh5MTBDV1A5Y1ROb1FRajhCTVZQMkh6SnRXNmJENElGOWVnLXFqSWFqLXZleTRwc2RieDFvYzRGWDRHd2ZmclFVSzk3NFN0bmI3ZkJtbHJfNV81dWtoeWEzNmVvN3dpZ0Q4dF8zVjV3WU1xOXpPMHRUVnNzMjd1REx0ZHloZ29ZWjlNajVwSS1LeTBHek9WSmE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNdWZDVTJkUDljYmx6SV91Y2Z0SEZRZzg0OUZCeFVYTk9sTkRWbmwzWlI5a2JCWWVoU2d2Y3pPcDd4dWRxdXNwZU5DU0NteGcySVZKM1VGZHZQQzRNRklWeXl6WlNEMFF4YWx0TjJfUFJvNkEyclpIYkZQZVF3MC10bWdGYndsTDE5TWo2RmtpNjZVWGpZbmFKVUM5alFxc1hG?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQQjNScGtXdE5ITXdHX0FHZkVNZUxHMFBfeFI0WTdEa1FXX09iQ3Ffbjk3M212NVRtUnNNWDNDNFdfRWNjQUlXemtwTjF6UHBLMno0ZXo4alU2emF0TnRzLVo5TXNjbGJHX0ZZbGU2R1ZHZHBIT0VOX1N5UDRCeFdMQkhGM09rZWRoc1VRVWFFSDNBdzM5SEFwN2ZxM0cyUnU2T09TMG5kT1ZzUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=